        "height": 0.28523870545158475
      },
      "regionId": "12.1-pdf-1",
      "boundaryStatus": "inside",
      "section": "knowledge",
      "sourceHeading": null,
      "markdown": "| $f(x)$ | $\\int f(x)\\,dx$ | $f(x)$ | $\\int f(x)\\,dx$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $0$ | $C$ | $1$ | $x+C$ |\n| $k$ | $kx+C$ | $x^n$ $(n\\ne-1)$ | $\\dfrac{x^{n+1}}{n+1}+C$ |\n| $\\dfrac{1}{x}$ | $\\ln|x|+C$ | $e^x$ | $e^x+C$ |\n| $a^x$ $(a>0, a\\ne1)$ | $\\dfrac{a^x}{\\ln a}+C$ | $\\sin x$ | $-\\cos x+C$ |\n| $\\cos x$ | $\\sin x+C$ | $\\dfrac{1}{\\cos^2x}$ | $\\tan x+C$ |\n| $\\dfrac{1}{\\sin^2x}$ | $-\\cot x+C$ | $\\tan x$ | $-\\ln|\\cos x|+C$ |\n| $\\cot x$ | $\\ln|\\sin x|+C$ | $\\dfrac{1}{1+x^2}$ | $\\arctan x+C$ |\n| $\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{1-x^2}}$ | $\\arcsin x+C$ | $\\dfrac{1}{a^2+x^2}$ | $\\dfrac{1}{a}\\arctan\\dfrac{x}{a}+C$ $(a>0)$ |",
