      "boundaryStatus": "inside",
      "section": "knowledge",
      "sourceHeading": null,
      "markdown": "$$\n\\int f'(x)[f(x)]^n dx = \\frac{[f(x)]^{n+1}}{n+1} + C \\quad (n \\neq -1)\n$$\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{f'(x)}{f(x)} dx = \\ln|f(x)| + C \\qquad \\int f'(x)e^{f(x)} dx = e^{f(x)} + C\n$$\n\n$$\n\\int f'(x)\\cos(f(x)) dx = \\sin(f(x)) + C, \\qquad \\int f'(x)\\sin(f(x)) dx = -\\cos(f(x)) + C.\n$$",
      "latex": [
        "\\int f'(x)[f(x)]^n dx = \\frac{[f(x)]^{n+1}}{n+1} + C \\quad (n \\neq -1)",
        "\\int \\frac{f'(x)}{f(x)} dx = \\ln|f(x)| + C \\qquad \\int f'(x)e^{f(x)} dx = e^{f(x)} + C",
        "\\int f'(x)\\cos(f(x)) dx = \\sin(f(x)) + C, \\qquad \\int f'(x)\\sin(f(x)) dx = -\\cos(f(x)) + C."
      ]
